# NebulaUI 1.0S (SakuraBlossom)
![nosp_banner.png](https://github.com/nebulauiteam/android_manifest/blob/lineage-21.0/assets/nosp_banner.png)
===========
Getting started
---------------

Welcome to NOSP (Nebula Open Source Project),
To get started with Android/NebulaUI, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop).

To initialize your local repository using the NebulaUI trees, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/nebulauiteam/android_manifest.git -b lineage-21.0 --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync
```
Please contact us at our [Discord Server](https://dsc.gg/nebulaos) for building instructions, by device.

